    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "神奈川県川崎市にある京濱伏見稲荷神社には、たくさんの神様がいます。",
      "english_translation": "There are many gods at Kyo-Hama Fushimi Inari Shrine, located in Kawasaki City, Kanagawa Prefecture."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "この赤い門は、鳥居といいます。",
      "english_translation": "This red gate is called a torii."
